-- statement:
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.KFTBase`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem NLogN.KFT.rpt_runs {A C D : Fin HS} (hAC : A ≠ C) (hAD : A ≠ D) (hCD : C ≠ D) (hAK : A ≠ sK)
--       (hCK : C ≠ sK) (hCK2 : C ≠ sK2) (hCY : C ≠ uY) (hCB : C ≠ uB)
--       (n : ℕ) (T : ℕ → IState HS)
--       (hTA : ∀ k, (T k).G A = (T 0).G A) (hTC : ∀ k, (T k).G C = (T 0).G C)
