--       (b : IStmt HS Pp) (c : ℕ)
--       (hb : ∀ k < n, ∀ LA LC LD, IRuns I iprog b (cf3 (T k) A C D LA LC LD)
--         (cf3 (T (k + 1)) A C D LA LC LD) c) :
--       IRuns I iprog (rpt A C D n b) (T 0) (T n) (n * (c + 64) + 60 + cRpt n)
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** The lemma belongs to the part *KFT §0: a counted repetition with a literal count*: `rpt A C D n b`: push the literal `n` on `A`, turn it into `n` marks on `C` (KFC `pro`, linear
--   `cUL n`), run `b` once per mark (`uloop`, `64` per iteration), clean up (`epi`) and drop `n`.
--   `rpt_runs`: if `b` takes `T k` to `T (k+1)` whatever `A, C, D` hold, then `rpt` takes `T 0` to
--   `T n` at cost `n (c + 64) + cRpt n`, `cRpt n = O(n + 1)`.
--
